    mee "I sold the land and your grandfather designed the restaurant. It was one of his last projects."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:154
translate english c26s001_MeeDate_51144d46:

    # mee "Yo vendí los terrenos y John hizo el proyecto del restaurante. Fue uno de sus últimos trabajos."
    mee "I sold the land and John designed the restaurant. It was one of his last projects."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:155
translate english c26s001_MeeDate_5098616f:

