translate english c26s001_MeeDate_4ca75ceb:

    # mee "John no llegó a verlo completado, ni a saber que el hotel no se construiría."
    mee "John never got to see it completed, nor did he ever learn that the hotel would never be built."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:157
translate english c26s001_MeeDate_4ce4b479:

