    mee "When your grandfather was diagnosed with cancer, he made me promise that I would rebuild my life without him."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:166
translate english c26s001_MeeDate_4ca1d8d2:

    # mee "Cuando a John le diagnosticaron el cáncer, me obligó a prometerle que reconstruiría mi vida sin él."
    mee "When John was diagnosed with cancer, he made me promise that I would rebuild my life without him."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:167
translate english c26s001_MeeDate_5bea8fa1:

    # mee "He tardado 23 años. Y un sitio que diseñó él me parece un buen lugar para empezar."
    mee "It took me 23 years. And a site he designed seems like a good place to start."

