    mee "They have restored a sense of excitement that I didn't remember having, if I ever had it in the first place."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:177
translate english c26s001_MeeDate_056ce8f9:

    # mc "Con el abuelo la tendrías, ¿no?"
    mc "You'd have it with Grandpa, wouldn't you?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:179
