    oma "I don't think you've looked good in your life, [sol]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:1529
translate english c26s002_Solomon_736e3492:

    # oma "Además, no te iba a servir de mucho. No va a volver contigo aunque ella quisiera."
    oma "Besides, it wouldn't have done you much good. She's not going to come back to you even if she wanted to."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:1531
translate english c26s002_Solomon_62ca9c3d:

    # sol "¿Aunque ella quisiera? ¿Significa eso que hay una oportunidad?"
