    # emm "¡Entonces tendría que cambiar todos los muebles! No quiero que mi habitación parezca hecha de muebles que he recogido en la basura."
    emm "Then I'd have to change all my furniture! I don't want my room to look like it's made of furniture I picked up at the dump."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2092
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_89744cdd:

    # emm "Quizás pueda pasar sin comprar demasiada ropa... Me gustan mis muebles..."
    emm "Maybe I can get by without buying too much clothes... I like my furniture..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2094
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_d5ccc777:

    # mom "Entonces solo queda precisamente lo que no considero un capricho."
    mom "Then all that remains is precisely what I do not consider a whim."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2095
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_ec1d529e:

    # mom "Creo que puedes montar el estudio de fotografía en el sótano sin ningún problema. Pero tú te ocupas de todo."
    mom "I think you can set up the photography studio in the basement without any problems. But you take care of everything that's needed."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2097
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_e30ac5df:

    # emm "Ya lo he estado mirando por internet... lo miré incluso antes de tener el dinero para hacerlo."
    emm "I've already been looking at it online... I looked at it even before I had the money to do it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2098
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_0ca45da2:

    # emm "Un par de fondos, iluminación, cámaras, objetivos... Es caro, pero asumible."
    emm "A couple of backdrops, lighting, cameras, lenses... It's expensive, but manageable."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2100
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_f4682895:

    # mom "Pero es una inversión en tu futuro, con lo que me parece un gasto correcto. Si quieres dedicarte a la fotografía tendrás que practicar mucho."
    mom "But it's an investment in your future, so I think it's money well spent. If you want to pursue photography, you'll have to practice a lot."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2101
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_ec288dfe:

    # mom "Y tener buen material para hacerlo es imprescindible."
    mom "And having good equipment to do the job is essential."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2103
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_519e8e2c:

    # emm "Además podré ayudar a [mad.nick] con sus diseños y a [kim] con su portfolio. Hay que aprovechar que tenemos una modelo profesional en la familia."
    emm "I will also be able to help [mad.nick] with her designs and [kim] with her portfolio. We have to take advantage of having a professional model in the family."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2104
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_344b0417:

    # emm "Incluso puedo empezar un canal de MeTube cuando tenga un poco de experiencia. Eso puede hacerme ganar dinero..."
    emm "I can even start a MeTube channel when I get some experience. That could make me some money..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2106
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_ad945b5a:

    # mom "*Risa* ¿Necesitas más dinero? Creo que no eres consciente de cuánto puedes abarcar con $83,000..."
    mom "*Laugh* Do you need more money? I don't think you realize how much you can do with $83,000..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2107
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_6d89e923:

    # mom "Si quieres hacerlo, no tengo nada en contra siempre y cuando no descuides tus estudios."
    mom "If you want to do it, I have nothing against it as long as you don't neglect your studies."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2109
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_6c7c3d3b:

    # emm "*Risa* Tienes razón. Lo del canal de MeTube lo pensé antes de recibir el dinero."
    emm "*Laugh* You're right. I thought about the MeTube channel before I got the money. I forgot I am rich now!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2110
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_d5e273bd:

    # emm "Pues creo que voy a pedir en Amazonian todo lo que necesito. Ya lo tengo guardado en mi lista de deseados."
    emm "Well, I think I'm going to order everything I need from Amazonian. I've already saved it to my wish list."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2111
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_ce29b46f:

    # emm "Queda el tema de pintar el sótano..."
    emm "That just leaves the matter of painting the basement..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2113
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_e74c0826:

    # mom "Puedes hacerlo tú misma, con ayuda de las chicas o de [mc], igual que pintamos la habitación de [sai]."
    mom "You can do it yourself, with help from the girls or [mc], just like when we painted [sai]'s room."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2114
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_94991dfb:

    # mom "O contratar a alguien para que lo haga. [nor] tiene los teléfonos de los proveedores si quieres llamar ya."
    mom "Or hire someone to do it. [nor] has the phone numbers of some contractors if you want to call them now."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2115
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_4afae7cd:

    # mom "O puedes buscar en mis archivos..."
    mom "Or you can search through my archives..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2117
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_7e84c963:

    # emm "*Risa* Mejor se lo pido a Tía [nor]. Estoy segura de que tú lo tienes en papel."
    emm "*Laugh* I'd better ask Aunt [nor]. I'm sure you have it on paper."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2119
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_673d479a:

    # mom "¿Qué tiene de malo el papel?"
    mom "What's wrong with paper?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2121
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_4489b1bf:

    # emm "No tenía nada de malo... hasta que entramos en el Siglo XXI. *Risa*"
    emm "There was nothing wrong with it... until we entered the 21st century. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2122
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_0cf28942:

    # emm "Te veo luego, Mamá."
    emm "See you later, Mom."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2125
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_ef0ae21b:

    # "Cuando estás a punto de entrar en la cocina, un bólido rosa impacta contra ti."
    "As you are about to enter the kitchen, a pink meteor hits you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2126
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_5613f4f6:

    # mc "¡[emm]! ¿Dónde vas tan deprisa y sin mirar por dónde vas?"
    mc "[emm]! Where are you going so fast without looking where you're walking?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2128
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_07e527c3:

    # emm "¡Tengo que ir a ver a Tía [nor]! ¡Mamá me ha dejado montar el estudio de fotografía en el sótano!"
    emm "I have to go see Aunt [nor]! Mom has agreed to let me set up my photography studio in the basement!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2129
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_6e2959bd:

    # mc "Genial. Ahora venía a hablar con Mamá de lo de tu paga semanal."
    mc "Great. I was just going to talk to Mom about your weekly allowance."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2131
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_19f357f6:

    # emm "No hace falta. Ya se lo he dicho yo. *Risa* Como me ha mirado con cara rara, le he dicho que era idea tuya."
    emm "No need. I already told her. *Laugh* Since she looked at me with a strange face, I told her it was your idea."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2132
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_a1cb8008:

    # emm "Después de pensarlo bien, me he dado cuenta de que tienes razón. No sería justo que me diera la paga si tengo tanto dinero."
    emm "After thinking it over, I realized that you're right. It wouldn't be fair for me to take my allowance when I have so much money."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2133
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_b41f37a3:

    # emm "Y ahora me tengo que ir. Quiero que el estudio esté acabado antes de que te vayas a Aruba."
    emm "And now I have to go. I want the studio finished before you leave for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2136
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_4f2398a5:

    # emm "Hasta luego, [mc]."
    emm "See you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2137
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_68457195:

    # mc "Hasta luego, [emm]."
    mc "See you later, [emm]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2143
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_7a1e393d:

    # mc "Hola, [mart]. Parece que has hecho feliz a [emm] con lo del estudio."
    mc "Hello, [mart]. It looks like you made [emm] happy with the photography studio."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2144
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_cb9e4405:

    # mom "Bueno, después de quitarle de la cabeza unas cuantas ideas locas, lo del estudio me ha parecido la mejor idea que ha tenido hoy."
    mom "Well, after getting a few crazy ideas out of her head, I think the studio is the best idea she's had so far today."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2145
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_39212817:

    # mc "Le servirá para practicar y además..."
    mc "It will help her practice and also..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2147
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_0a4dd6e2:

    # mom "Sí, me lo ha dicho, para ayudar a [kim] y a [mad.nick]."
    mom "Yes, she told me, to help [kim] and [mad.nick]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2148
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_ae9729d0:

    # mc "Exacto. [emm] cada vez más piensa en ayudar a los demás, en vez de ayudarse a si misma."
    mc "Exactly. [emm] increasingly thinks about helping others instead of helping herself."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2149
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_6faf27fb:

    # mc "Creo que es un efecto imprevisto de la llegada de las chicas."
    mc "I think it's an unexpected effect of the girls living here."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2151
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_bdafe188:

    # mom "No solo eso. El resto de las chicas también están siendo una buena influencia en ella."
    mom "Not only that, but the other girls are also being a good influence on her."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2152
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_50fe29b4:

    # mom "Sabes que siempre ha sido bastante tacaña, y cuando fue a Monterey nos trajo un regalo a cada una. ¡Lencería!"
    mom "You know she's always been pretty frugal, and when you went to Monterey, she brought us each a gift. Lingerie!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2154
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_73177715:

    # mc "Lo sé. Es sorprendente, pero es un cambio bienvenido."
    mc "I know. It's surprising, but it's a welcome change."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2156
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_a7ce1d1c:

    # mc "Es sorprendente, pero es un cambio bienvenido."
    mc "It's surprising, but it's a welcome change."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2158
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_1766952b:

    # mc "Tengo ganas de ver cómo te queda lo que te compró a ti."
    mc "I can't wait to see how what she bought you looks on you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2159
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_5c7a58b8:

    # mc "Pero antes quiero mi beso de buenos días."
    mc "But first, I want my good morning kiss."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2161
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_6f4a6cb9:

    # mom "Eso es muy fácil de cumplir. Buenos días, [mc]."
    mom "That's easy enough. Good morning, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2162
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_6d5a6b3f:

    # mc "Buenos días, [mart]."
    mc "Good morning, [mart]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2164
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_f46bd6c3:

    # mom "La lencería que me compró es muy bonita, además acertó tanto con mi talla como con el color que me gusta."
    mom "The lingerie she bought me is very pretty, and she got both the size and the color I like just right."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2165
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_b59683c1:

    # mom "Ella y yo usamos casi la misma talla, con lo que no era difícil acertar. Pero no me hubiera sorprendido que la hubiera comprado en rosa en vez de negro."
    mom "She and I wear almost the same size, so it wasn't difficult to get it right. But I wouldn't have been surprised if she had bought it in pink instead of black."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2166
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_ad7a9546:

    # mc "*Risa* Estoy seguro de que el rosa te sentaría genial."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm sure pink would look great on you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2168
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_76d0d51b:

    # mc "Volviendo al tema del dinero de NTR, ¿necesitas algo?"
    mc "Getting back to the subject of NTR money, do you need anything?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2169
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_f0443aed:

    # mom "No, nada. La transferencia ha sido una sorpresa. [nor] y yo la esperábamos en diciembre, como cada año."
    mom "No, nothing. The transfer was a surprise. [nor] and I were expecting it in December, like every year."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2170
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_a11cd6c5:

    # mc "Cuando las chicas me han hablado de la transferencia, me ha sorprendido que llegara ahora. Estaba seguro de que llegaba a final de año."
    mc "When the girls told me about the transfer, I was surprised that it was happening now. I was sure it would be at the end of the year."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2171
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_5d6d6510:

    # mc "Si hubiéramos sabido esto, no hubiera sido necesario montar el dormitorio para las chicas."
    mc "If we had known this, it would not have been necessary to set up the dorm for the girls."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2173
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_8c61834b:

    # mom "No lo sabíamos. Pero aunque lo hubiéramos sabido, lo habríamos hecho igualmente una vez tu padre se fue."
    mom "We didn't know. But even if we had known, we would have done it anyway once your father left."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2174
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_bcc7e493:

    # mom "NTR... ¿o debería decir GILF?... siempre ha sido poco transparente, y tener otra fuente de ingresos da tranquilidad."
    mom "NTR... or should I say GILF?... has always been a bit shady, and having another source of income gives me peace of mind."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2175
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_7860ef94:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. ¿Qué vamos a hacer ahora con el dormitorio?"
    mc "I understand. What are we going to do with the dorm now?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2177
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_c3ce14c7:

    # mom "¿A qué te refieres?"
    mom "What do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2178
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_c4e846eb:

    # mc "Ahora NTR es nuestro. No necesitamos el dormitorio para vivir. No digo que lo cerremos, pero..."
    mc "NTR is ours, now. We don't need the dorm to live off it. I'm not saying we should close it, but..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2180
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_363d9226:

    # mom "No tengo intención de cerrarlo. Primero, porque las chicas viven aquí. Creo que su llegada nos ha ido bien a todos."
    mom "I have no intention of closing it. First, because the girls live here. I think their arrival has been good for all of us."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2181
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_925f1ca5:

    # mom "Acabamos de hablar de lo buena influencia que son para [emm]."
    mom "We just talked about what a good influence they are for [emm]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2182
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_4733bf30:

    # mc "Estoy de acuerdo. Pero supongo que hay un segundo punto."
    mc "I agree. But I guess there's a second point."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2184
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_7ced340d:

    # mom "A quien mejor le ha ido es a mí. ¿Te acuerdas de cómo estaba cuando llegaste?"
    mom "The one who has benefited the most is me. Do you remember how I was when you arrived?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2185
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_9cbbaf5b:

    # mc "Por supuesto que me acuerdo. En un proceso de depresión."
    mc "Of course I remember. You were going through a bout of depression."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2187
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_0ee3acaf:

    # mom "Imagínate cómo hubiera estado si no hubiera estado ocupada con montar el dormitorio."
    mom "Imagine how it would have been if I hadn't been busy setting up the dorm."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2188
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_8f462066:

    # mom "He descubierto que llevo demasiados años ociosa, y tener algo que hacer me ayudó mucho."
    mom "I discovered that I have been idle for too many years, and having something to do helped me a lot."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2189
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_e740edb4:

    # mom "Además, me encanta cocinar para mucha gente."
    mom "Also, I love cooking for a lot of people."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2190
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_8d5b386c:

    # mc "Creo que en vez de montar un dormitorio deberías haber montado un restaurante."
    mc "I think that instead of setting up a dorm, you should have set up a restaurant."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2192
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_5c1b5967:

    # mom "Lo pensé, pero hubiera sido más caro y no tendríamos a las chicas, con lo que me alegro de no haberlo hecho."
    mom "I thought about it, but it would have been more expensive, and we wouldn't have had the girls, so I'm glad we didn't."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2193
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_3ad3538c:

    # mom "Además, no tendríamos la subvención de la Universidad, con lo que hubiera sido mucho más arriesgado."
    mom "Furthermore, we wouldn't have had the university grant, which would have made it much riskier."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2194
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_89aacbb9:

    # mom "Quizás en el futuro..."
    mom "Maybe in the future..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2195
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_b43f15f5:

    # mc "Bueno, hasta que llegue ese futuro, tienes un montón de gente a la que alimentar en casa. *Risa*"
    mc "Well, until that future arrives, you have a lot of people to feed at home. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2197
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_616c19af:

    # mom "*Risa* Lo estoy intentando, pero entre tú y [emm] me estáis retrasando."
    mom "*Laugh* I'm trying, but you and [emm] are slowing me down."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2198
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_e2075794:

    # mc "Entonces voy a dejar que sigas cocinando. Estaré en mi habitación si necesitas algo."
    mc "Then I'll let you get back to cooking. I'll be in my room if you need anything."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2200
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_cbd3ab46:

    # "Vuelves a tu habitación y compruebas las cuentas bancarias. Tú también has recibido la transferencia."
    "You return to your room and check your bank accounts. You have also received the transfer."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2201
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_57a51954:

    # "Además de una segunda transferencia, bastante menor en comparación, en la que pone 'Nómina'."
    "In addition to a second transfer, which is smaller in comparison, labeled 'Salary'."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2202
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_5a34682c:

    # "Compruebas el correo electrónico, donde encuentras una hoja de salario. Haces unos cálculos y silbas sorprendido."
    "You check your email, where you find a pay slip. You do some calculations and whistle in surprise."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2203
translate english c26s004_MarEmm_2a53dbd5:

    # "Tu sueldo como CEO de NTR sobrepasa el medio millón de dólares anuales antes de impuestos."
    "Your salary as CEO of NTR exceeds half a million dollars per year before taxes."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2212
translate english c26s004_Cafe_4c728d41:

    # "Después de comer, llevas a [eri] y a [eil] al café. Tienes que hacer algunas compras en el centro de la ciudad y aprovechas el viaje."
    "After lunch, you take [eri] and [eil] to the café. You have some shopping to do downtown, so you take advantage of the trip to give the girls a ride."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2214
translate english c26s004_Cafe_e3c7c525:

    # eil "Gracias por el viaje, [mc]. Voy a ir a cambiarme. Aún nos quedan 15 minutos para empezar nuestro turno."
    eil "Thanks for the ride, [mc]. I'm going to go change. We still have 15 minutes before our shift starts."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2215
translate english c26s004_Cafe_83071598:

    # eri "A veces te envidio por tener una taquilla propia aquí. Yo tengo que venir vestida de casa."
    eri "Sometimes I envy you for having your own locker here. I have to come dressed from home."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2216
translate english c26s004_Cafe_1b2c7c28:

    # mc "¿Habéis pensado en compartir taquilla? No sé el tamaño que tienen, pero..."
    mc "Have you thought about sharing [eil]'s locker? I don't know how big they are, but..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2218
translate english c26s004_Cafe_55cdf4b6:

    # eil "¡Somos idiotas!"
    eil "We're idiots!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2219
translate english c26s004_Cafe_943ceca2:

    # eri "¿Puedes creerte que nunca se nos ha ocurrido? Y eso que guardo mis cosas de valor en su taquilla..."
    eri "Can you believe we never thought of that? And that's even though I keep my valuables in her locker."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2220
translate english c26s004_Cafe_68f2b2b5:

    # mc "A veces tenemos la solución delante de las narices y no la vemos."
    mc "Sometimes the solution is right in front of us, but we don't see it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2221
translate english c26s004_Cafe_4f2f48af:

    # eil "¡Pero si incluso sabe la combinación y mis cosas están en su bolso!"
    eil "But she even knows the combination, and my things are in her bag!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2222
translate english c26s004_Cafe_8b01342a:

    # eri "Y la uso cuando no estás y no se nos había ocurrido nunca. ¡Somos idiotas!"
    eri "And I use it when you're not working, and it never occurred to us before. We're idiots!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2224
translate english c26s004_Cafe_4daecb71:

    # eil "Dame tus cosas y las meto en la taquilla. Voy a cambiarme antes de que se haga tarde. ¿Un café?"
    eil "Give me your things and I'll put them in the locker. I'm going to get changed before it gets late. Coffee?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2225
translate english c26s004_Cafe_8ad44628:

    # eri "Sí, por favor. Dile a Roger que nos lo traiga a la mesa."
    eri "Yes, please. Tell Roger to bring it to our table."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2226
translate english c26s004_Cafe_39c5389d:

    # mc "Un espresso para mí, por favor."
    mc "An espresso for me, please."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2228
translate english c26s004_Cafe_eaac436b:

    # mc "No sé cómo no se os había ocurrido lo de la taquilla."
    mc "I don't know how you didn't think about the locker."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2229
translate english c26s004_Cafe_b6e6da3a:

    # eri "Supongo que, como nos dijeron que era personal, no hemos pensado más allá. Dejar el bolso y que me diera su combinación ya nos parecía que era romper las reglas."
    eri "I guess since they told us it was personal, we didn't think any further than that. Leaving the bag and giving me the combination already seemed like breaking the rules to us."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2230
translate english c26s004_Cafe_c1d92e99:

    # mc "Parece que habéis pensado tan solo dentro del marco de las reglas. Pero bueno, ya está resuelto."
    mc "It seems that you have only thought within the framework of the rules. But anyway, it's settled now."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2232
translate english c26s004_Cafe_b17e1be7:

    # eri "Le pediré permiso a mi jefe para hacerlo. No quiero que me despidan por algo así si me ven hurgando en la taquilla de [eil]."
    eri "I'll ask my boss for permission to do it. I don't want to get fired for something like that, if they see me rummaging through [eil]'s locker."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2233
translate english c26s004_Cafe_649d4454:

    # eri "Siempre que metía el bolso cuando ella no estaba, me parecía que me iban a decir que le estaba robando o algo así."
    eri "Whenever I put my bag there when she wasn't working, I felt like someone was going to tell me I was stealing from her or something."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2234
translate english c26s004_Cafe_b94d4674:

    # mc "Parece una buena idea aclararlo con tu jefe antes de hacer nada."
    mc "It sounds like a good idea to clarify this with your boss before doing anything."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2235
translate english c26s004_Cafe_422ce96c:

    # mc "¿El chico que nos ha traído el café es el sustituto de Jack? ¿El que no está funcionando bien?"
    mc "Is the guy who brought us the coffee Jack's replacement? The one who isn't performing well?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2237
translate english c26s004_Cafe_88569d1c:

    # eri "Sí, es un buen chico, pero no sirve para esto. Se aturde cuando llega mucha gente de golpe y se queda paralizado."
    eri "Yes, he's a good guy, but he's not cut out for this. He gets overwhelmed when a lot of people show up at once and he freezes up."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2238
translate english c26s004_Cafe_bd2c67e8:

    # eri "Y no ha mejorado en... creo que lleva más de dos semanas aquí. Sólo tienes que ver que hay mesas sucias..."
    eri "And it hasn't improved in... I think he's been here for over two weeks. Just look at the dirty tables..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2239
translate english c26s004_Cafe_64ad3bf2:

    # mc "Puedes aprovechar la conversación de la taquilla para hablarle a tu jefe de [sca]."
    mc "You can use the conversation about the locker to talk to your boss about [sca]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2241
translate english c26s004_Cafe_a1c6baa9:

    # eri "Sí, lo haré. Me ha sorprendido que quiera trabajar aquí. Le queda un mes para empezar las clases. Pero me hará ilusión si la contratan."
    eri "Yes, I will. I'm surprised she wants to work here. She has a month before classes start. But I'll be thrilled if they hire her."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2242
translate english c26s004_Cafe_1b38bdcb:

    # mc "Ya la has oído. Cree que tiene la obligación de colaborar económicamente en casa. Por mucho que le digamos que está equivocada, no va a cambiar de opinión."
    mc "You've heard her say it. She believes she has an obligation to contribute financially to the family. No matter how much we tell her she's wrong, she won't change her mind."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2244
translate english c26s004_Cafe_d66364ec:

    # eri "*Risa* Es tan cabezona como [dap]. A veces pienso que es su hermana en vez de serlo yo."
    eri "*Laugh* She's as stubborn as [dap]. Sometimes I think she's her sister instead of me."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2245
translate english c26s004_Cafe_8025db38:

    # mc "Somos una familia de cabezones cuando se trata de ayudar, ¿no?"
    mc "We're a family of stubborn people when it comes to helping others, aren't we?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2247
translate english c26s004_Cafe_ef02c2eb:

    # eri "Un poco. *Risa* Pero es una de las mejores cosas de esta familia."
    eri "A little. *Laugh* But it's one of the best things about this family."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2248
translate english c26s004_Cafe_0214e077:

    # mc "Y supongo que lo de no dejar el trabajo y gastarte el dinero será para ayudar a alguien también, ¿verdad?"
    mc "And I assume that not quitting your job and spending your money is because you want to help someone else, right?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2249
translate english c26s004_Cafe_7bb0b1a3:

    # eri "*Risa* A veces da miedo que nos conozcamos tanto."
    eri "*Laugh* Sometimes it's scary how well we know each other."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2251
translate english c26s004_Cafe_61323857:

    # eri "¿Sabes qué planes tienen la abuela y Tía [bet] cuando venda la casa de Florida?"
    eri "Do you know what Grandma and Aunt [bet] have planned for when they sell the house in Florida?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2252
translate english c26s004_Cafe_a1db6345:

    # mc "Oí que quería comprar o alquilar algo aquí, en la ciudad."
    mc "I heard they wanted to buy or rent something here in town."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2254
translate english c26s004_Cafe_60c9cb88:

    # eri "Exacto. Y pasaría como con [sim], [mad.nick], o [oma]. Vendrían a la comida del domingo y una o dos veces entre semana."
    eri "Exactly. And it would be the same as with [sim], [mad.nick], or [oma]. They would come over for Sunday lunch and once or twice during the week."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2255
translate english c26s004_Cafe_1a2d91fd:

    # eri "He estado hablando con Tía [bet] y le he preguntado por qué no compran el terreno enfrente de casa y mandan construir una casa allí."
    eri "I've been talking to Aunt [bet] and told her they should buy the plot of land across the road and have a house built there."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2256
translate english c26s004_Cafe_fe02e80d:

    # eri "No debería ser muy caro para ellas dos y alguna habitación extra. La casa de la abuela en Florida es mucho más grande."
    eri "It shouldn't be too expensive for the two of them and an extra room in case they need to put someone up. Grandma's house in Florida is much bigger."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2257
translate english c26s004_Cafe_e47264a2:

    # mc "Y le has ofrecido el dinero de NTR por si lo necesitan, ¿no?"
    mc "And you offered them NTR's money if they need it, right?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2259
translate english c26s004_Cafe_ebdd9396:

    # eri "Sí. Mi madre no lo va a coger y yo no lo necesito, con lo que me parecía la mejor inversión."
    eri "Yes. My mother won't take it, and I don't need it, so it struck me as the best investment."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2260
translate english c26s004_Cafe_ddeaa8fb:

    # mc "No tengo ni idea de cuánto se tarda en construir una casa o cuánto puede costar."
    mc "I have no idea how long it takes to build a house or how much it might cost."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2261
translate english c26s004_Cafe_31d12931:

    # eri "Yo tampoco. Quien más sabe de eso es la abuela, precisamente. Pero le he dicho a Tía [bet] que si necesitan el dinero pueden contar con él."
    eri "Me neither. Grandma knows the most about that, actually. But I told Aunt [bet] that, if they need the money, they can count on it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2262
translate english c26s004_Cafe_45d819d5:

    # mc "¿Por qué no se lo has dicho directamente a la abuela?"
    mc "Why didn't you just tell Grandma?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2264
translate english c26s004_Cafe_a9fcac63:

    # eri "Porque rechazaría el dinero. Si Tía [bet] lo disfraza como parte de su indemnización tendrá que aceptarlo, porque ese era el plan inicial."
    eri "Because she would refuse the money. If Aunt [bet] disguises it as part of her severance payment, she will have to accept it, because that was the original plan."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2266
translate english c26s004_Cafe_23c4da2f:

    # eri "*Risita* Además, no creo que después de vuestra sesión de anoche tenga el cerebro demasiado lúcido."
    eri "*Giggle* Besides, I don't think her brain was working too well after your session last night."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2267
translate english c26s004_Cafe_0a60b761:

    # mc "*Risa* Es posible, no voy a negarlo."
    mc "*Laugh* It's possible, I won't deny it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2268
translate english c26s004_Cafe_151a328d:

    # mc "Pero hacer que Tía [bet] mienta sobre el origen del dinero..."
    mc "But making Aunt [bet] lie about where the money came from..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2270
translate english c26s004_Cafe_70d20c6e:

    # eri "*Risa* No va a mentir. Le va a decir 'Yo puedo aportar X para una casa nueva', y dentro de esa X está mi dinero."
    eri "*Laugh* She's not going to lie. She's going to say, 'I can contribute X to a new house', and that X includes my money."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2271
translate english c26s004_Cafe_e76bef35:

    # eri "Fíjate que nadie miente últimamente. Ni siquiera [emm]. Disfrazamos la verdad. Nos estamos convirtiendo en las magas de aquellos libros que leías hace años."
    eri "Notice that nobody lies anymore. Not even [emm]. We disguise the truth. We are becoming the magicians from those books you read years ago."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2272
translate english c26s004_Cafe_dd9ceb72:

    # mc "Sí, el Círculo del Tiempo. Espero que no os convirtáis en tan ruines como eran algunas de ellas."
    mc "Yes, The Circle of Time. I hope you don't turn out to be as nasty as some of them were."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2274
translate english c26s004_Cafe_a9b0202c:

    # eri "No lo vamos a hacer. No hay necesidad de mentir, pero a veces no conviene decir toda la verdad."
    eri "We're not going to do it. There's no need to lie, but sometimes it's better not to tell the whole truth."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2275
translate english c26s004_Cafe_6ed3a191:

    # eri "Y saber que alguien nos está viendo por las cámaras todo el día ayuda. Ninguna queremos que [eva] o [ama] piensen que somos unas mentirosas."
    eri "And knowing that someone is watching us on camera all day helps. None of us want [eva] or [ama] to think we're liars."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2276
translate english c26s004_Cafe_9cdb36b9:

    # mc "*Risa* Perder privacidad para ganar en sinceridad. No me parece un mal cambio, sobre todo con [emm]."
    mc "*Laugh* Losing privacy to gain sincerity. I don't think it's a bad trade, especially for [emm]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2277
translate english c26s004_Cafe_64b16f6d:

    # mc "Aunque me sorprendería si alguna vez aprendiera a mentir. Siempre ha sido horrible en eso."
    mc "Although I'd be surprised if she could ever learn to lie. She was always terrible at it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2279
translate english c26s004_Cafe_a3be9d09:

    # eil "[eri], tenemos que empezar el turno."
    eil "[eri], we have to start our shift."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2281
translate english c26s004_Cafe_8abc2192:

    # eil "Por cierto, [mc], ¿podrías pasar por el supermercado y comprar unas latas de atún cuando vuelvas a casa?"
    eil "By the way, [mc], could you stop by the supermarket and pick up some cans of tuna on your way home?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2282
translate english c26s004_Cafe_b33ac7b1:

    # eil "[nor] dice que creía tener varias latas en la despensa, pero que debía estar equivocada."
    eil "[nor] says she thought she had several cans in the pantry, but she couldn't find any."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2283
translate english c26s004_Cafe_fbe1d9a1:

    # mc "¿Cuántas latas de atún le disteis a Zeus ayer?"
    mc "How many cans of tuna did you give Zeus yesterday?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2285
translate english c26s004_Cafe_79b54081:

    # eil "Yo sólo le di una, después de preguntarle a [mad.nick]. Aunque sean individuales, son mucho atún para un gatito."
    eil "I only gave him one, after asking [mad.nick]. Even if they're individual portions, that's a lot of tuna for a kitten."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2287
translate english c26s004_Cafe_2aa10b94:

    # mc "¿[eri]?"
    mc "[eri]?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2288
translate english c26s004_Cafe_90db3097:

    # eri "*Silba*"
    eri "*Whistles*"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2289
translate english c26s004_Cafe_99d2005c:

    # mc "¿[eri]? ¿Cuánto le diste de comer al gato?"
    mc "[eri]? How much did you feed the cat?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2291
translate english c26s004_Cafe_6a44abf1:

    # eri "*Cough* ¡Mira qué hora es! ¡Nuestro turno va a empezar!"
    eri "*Cough* Look at the time! It's almost time for our shift to start!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2292
translate english c26s004_Cafe_42237178:

    # mc "*Risa* Mas de una lata, ¿verdad?"
    mc "*Laugh* More than a can, right?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2294
translate english c26s004_Cafe_8d1b50fd:

    # eri "Es que es tan mono y tan agradecido..."
    eri "He's just so cute and so grateful..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2295
translate english c26s004_Cafe_09ee054f:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo vais a convertir en un cerdo si cada una de vosotras lo alimenta por separado."
    mc "*Laugh* You're going to turn him into a pig if each one of you feeds him separately."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2299
translate english c26s004_Cafe_e2e03462:

    # eil "*Risa* Un poco más gordito sería aún más achuchable. Como tú antes de irte a la universidad."
    eil "*Laugh* A little fatter would make him even more cuddly. Like you were before you went to college."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2300
translate english c26s004_Cafe_36c354c0:

    # mc "*Risa* Y también rompería más camas."
    mc "*Laugh* And he would break more beds."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2301
translate english c26s004_Cafe_05215b09:

    # eil "*Risa* Tienes razón. Te vemos luego en casa."
    eil "*Laugh* You're right. See you later at home."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2305
translate english c26s004_Cafe_c187f0c1:

    # eri "Además, [mad.nick] nos dijo que podíamos darle de comer."
    eri "In addition, [mad.nick] told us that we could feed him."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2306
translate english c26s004_Cafe_09ebe06c:

    # mc "¡Pero en cantidades normales para un cachorro! *Risa* No tres o cuatro latas cada una de vosotras."
    mc "But in normal amounts for a kitten! *Laugh* Not three or four cans each."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2307
translate english c26s004_Cafe_64bc4ff9:

    # eri "Bueno, si no lo hubiéramos hecho, no podrías comprar una cama más grande. Hasta luego, [mc]. Es hora de empezar a trabajar."
    eri "Well, if we hadn't, you wouldn't be able to buy a bigger bed. See you later, [mc]. Time to get to work."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2309
translate english c26s004_Cafe_06c19c51:

    # mc "Hasta luego, chicas."
    mc "See you later, girls."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2317
translate english c26s004_SamSim_88f951e3:

    # "Cuando llegas al supermercado te encuentras con una cara conocida."
    "When you arrive at the supermarket, you see a familiar face."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2318
translate english c26s004_SamSim_76f4fd6f:

    # "O con una espalda conocida, en este caso."
    "Or rather a familiar back, in this case."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2321
translate english c26s004_SamSim_1e5a88c6:

    # "No puedes resistirte a darle una suave palmada en el culo."
    "You can't resist giving her a gentle pat on the butt."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2323
translate english c26s004_SamSim_2c95fb46:

    # sam "¡Puto pervertido...!"
    sam "Fucking perve...!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2325
translate english c26s004_SamSim_121e910c:

    # sam "¡Oh! Eres tú. Has estado a punto de que te dé un bofetón."
    sam "Oh! It's you. You nearly made me slap you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2326
translate english c26s004_SamSim_8259a262:

    # mc "*Risa* Menos mal que eres de reflejos rápidos. Te cambio el bofetón por un beso."
    mc "*Laugh* Good thing you have quick reflexes. I'll trade the slap for a kiss."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2328
translate english c26s004_SamSim_6de1f84b:

    # sam "Eso es fácil de cumplir."
    sam "That's easy to comply with."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2330
translate english c26s004_SamSim_5b98e4a4:

    # "Buenas tardes, [sam]."
    "Good afternoon, [sam]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2332
translate english c26s004_SamSim_6b92add1:

    # sam "¡Oh! No esperaba verte por aquí."
    sam "Oh! I didn't expect to see you here."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2333
translate english c26s004_SamSim_e9661880:

    # mc "¿No trabajas hoy?"
    mc "Aren't you working today?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2335
translate english c26s004_SamSim_d509e6c5:

    # sam "He salido de un turno largo hace un rato. Necesitaba llenar la nevera, y aprovecharme de la mula de carga..."
    sam "I just got off a long shift a little while ago. I needed to stock up the fridge and take advantage of the pack mule..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2336
translate english c26s004_SamSim_ac16032a:

    # mc "¿Mula de carga?"
    mc "The pack mule?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2338
translate english c26s004_SamSim_b570b2b1:

    # sim "Esa soy yo. *Risa*"
    sim "That's me. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2343
translate english c26s004_SamSim_4b62b892:

    # sim "Buenos tardes, [mc]."
    sim "Good afternoon, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2344
translate english c26s004_SamSim_b7bdb224:

    # mc "*Risa* Creía que la mula de carga sería Jamaal. Al menos él va con ruedas."
    mc "*Laugh* I thought Jamaal would be the pack mule. At least he has wheels."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2346
translate english c26s004_SamSim_416ee78a:

    # sam "No sé dónde está. Cuando he llegado a casa no estaba."
    sam "I don't know where he is. When I got home, he wasn't there."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2348
translate english c26s004_SamSim_5f20f3f4:

    # sim "Ha quedado con un amigo para comer. No sé quién puede aguantarlo aparte de ti."
    sim "He's meeting a friend for lunch. I didn't know anyone could put up with him except for you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2349
translate english c26s004_SamSim_0c78f95c:

    # mc "Es lo que estaba pensando. Ya van dos veces que me decís que ha quedado con alguien."
    mc "That's what I was thinking. This is the second time you've told me he's meeting someone."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2350
translate english c26s004_SamSim_aa0e58c6:

    # mc "No estará saliendo con alguien, ¿no?"
    mc "He's not dating anyone, is he?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2352
translate english c26s004_SamSim_b53bb097:

    # sim "No creo... Aunque últimamente ha estado raro... O más raro de lo normal."
    sim "I don't think so... Although he has been acting strange lately... Or stranger than usual."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2353
translate english c26s004_SamSim_1733c28e:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Más raro? Eso es difícil para tu hermano."
    mc "*Laugh* Even stranger? That's hard for your brother."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2355
translate english c26s004_SamSim_cc708303:

    # sam "Lleva mucho sin salir con nadie. Y sale poco de casa... O salía poco de casa hasta hace un par de semanas."
    sam "He hasn't dated anyone in a long time. And he doesn't leave the house much... Or at least he didn't until a couple of weeks ago."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2356
translate english c26s004_SamSim_af2f9197:

    # sam "Si sale con alguien, no sé dónde puede haberlo conocido."
    sam "If he's dating anyone, I have no idea where he might have met him."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2357
translate english c26s004_SamSim_23af8d21:

    # mc "¿Online, quizás? Se pasa la vida pegado a una pantalla, con lo que no sería descabellado."
    mc "Online, perhaps? He spends his life glued to a screen, so it wouldn't be far-fetched."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2358
translate english c26s004_SamSim_f08db09a:

    # mc "Pero bueno, si está saliendo con alguien y nos lo quiere contar, ya lo hará cuando llegue el momento."
    mc "But hey, if he's dating someone and wants to tell us about it, he'll do so when the time is right."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2360
translate english c26s004_SamSim_136f859f:

    # sam "No creo que esté saliendo con nadie. Te lo hubiera contado a ti por lo menos, ¿no?"
    sam "I don't think he's dating anyone. He would have told you at least, right?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2361
translate english c26s004_SamSim_c5fdd0d9:

    # mc "Si lo hace, seguramente seré el primero a quien se lo cuente. Cuando esté preparado."
    mc "If he does, I'll be the first to know. When he's ready to tell me."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2362
translate english c26s004_SamSim_4c61c59b:

    # mc "A lo mejor solo es un amigo con el que queda para hablar de videojuegos y le estamos dando demasiada importancia a sus... rarezas."
    mc "Maybe he's just a friend he hangs out with to talk about video games, and we're reading too much into his... oddities."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2364
translate english c26s004_SamSim_9872e953:

    # sam "Tienes razón. A lo mejor sólo es Jamaal siendo Jamaal."
    sam "You're right. Maybe it's just Jamaal being Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2365
translate english c26s004_SamSim_e2583911:

    # sam "Y por cierto, gracias por comportarte como tú mismo."
    sam "And by the way, thank you for behaving like [mc] being [mc]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2366
translate english c26s004_SamSim_0c09ea15:

    # mc "No tengo ni idea de a lo que te estás refiriendo. ¿Qué he hecho esta vez?"
    mc "I have no idea what you're talking about. What have I done this time?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2368
translate english c26s004_SamSim_8acd9480:

    # sam "Convencer a mi cabezota hija para que vaya a entrenar con [deb.nick] a la Universidad."
    sam "Convincing my stubborn daughter to go train with [deb.nick] at the university."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2370
translate english c26s004_SamSim_219e570b:

    # sim "¡Mamá!"
    sim "Mooom!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2371
translate english c26s004_SamSim_4435834d:

    # mc "*Risa* Un poco cabezota sí que eres. Casi tanto como tu hermano."
    mc "*Laugh* You are a bit stubborn. Almost as much as your brother."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2373
translate english c26s004_SamSim_2ee64329:

    # sim "¡No te pases! ¡Nadie es tan cabezota como mi hermano!"
    sim "Don't go overboard! No one is as stubborn as my brother!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2374
translate english c26s004_SamSim_11bd0d49:

    # mc "¿Estás segura? Hace un par de días no querías entrenar con [deb.nick]..."
    mc "Are you sure? A couple of days ago you didn't want to train with [deb.nick]..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2376
translate english c26s004_SamSim_8bff050c:

    # sam "Y si no fuera por lo que hicisteis tú y ella, [sim] seguiría sin querer ir."
    sam "And if it weren't for what you and she did, [sim] still wouldn't want to do it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2377
translate english c26s004_SamSim_54f3b9d3:

    # sam "Parece que si no puede ganar, no quiere competir. Ni siquiera entrenar."
    sam "If it looks like she can't win, she doesn't want to compete. Not even to train."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2378
translate english c26s004_SamSim_529d41d9:

    # mc "Es lo que yo le dije. Al menos, por una vez, entró en razón y tomó una decisión correcta."
    mc "That's what I told her. At least, for once, she came to her senses and made the right decision."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2380
translate english c26s004_SamSim_446018e9:

    # sim "Si no lo hubiera hecho, [deb.nick] y tú aún os estaríais riendo de mí e ignorando todo lo que dijera."
    sim "If I hadn't, [deb.nick] and you would still be laughing at me and ignoring everything I said like I wasn't there."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2381
translate english c26s004_SamSim_53ce7749:

    # mc "Funcionó, ¿no? Significa que lo hicimos bien."
    mc "It worked, didn't it? That means we did something right."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2383
translate english c26s004_SamSim_5810aaef:

    # sim "¿Podemos cambiar de tema? Parece que entre los dos me estéis echando la bronca."
    sim "Can we change the subject? It seems like you're both scolding me."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2384
translate english c26s004_SamSim_aa095663:

    # mc "Vale. *Risa* ¿Cómo es que habéis venido a este supermercado? ¿Ha cerrado el que tenéis al lado de casa?"
    mc "Okay. *Laugh* How did you end up at this supermarket? Is the one near your house closed?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2386
translate english c26s004_SamSim_e38379b9:

    # sam "No, pero este es algo más barato. El mes pasado me dieron pocas horas extras y... Bueno, teníamos que comprar mucho, con lo que el ahorro se nota."
    sam "No, but this one is a bit cheaper. Last month I didn't get many extra hours and... Well, we had to buy a lot, so the savings really add up."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2387
translate english c26s004_SamSim_bcb2b0e9:

    # mc "[sam], si necesitáis algo no tenéis nada más que pedirlo."
    mc "[sam], if you need anything, just ask."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2389
translate english c26s004_SamSim_53245d97:

    # sam "No voy a aceptar caridad, [mc]. Ya hacéis suficiente por nosotros."
    sam "I won't accept charity, [mc]. You have already done enough for us."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2391
translate english c26s004_SamSim_1b9ffe42:

    # sim "¿Quieres ofendernos, [mc]? Porque lo estás consiguiendo."
    sim "Are you trying to offend us, [mc]? Because you're succeeding."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2392
translate english c26s004_SamSim_72e67432:

    # mc "Tan sólo os digo que si necesitáis algo, estoy aquí."
    mc "I'm just letting you know that if you need anything, I'm here."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2394
translate english c26s004_SamSim_9d1d8adc:

    # mc "Salgo con las dos, ofenderos es lo último que querría."
    mc "I'm dating both of you; the last thing I want to do is cause any offense."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2396
translate english c26s004_SamSim_08fd9269:

    # mc "Salgo con tu madre, ofenderla es lo último que querría."
    mc "I'm dating your mother; the last thing I want to do is cause any offense."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2398
translate english c26s004_SamSim_45c808a0:

    # mc "Salgo contigo, ofenderte es lo último que querría."
    mc "I'm dating you; the last thing I want to do is cause any offense."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2400
translate english c26s004_SamSim_faf861d4:

    # mc "Sois de la familia, ofenderos es lo último que querría."
    mc "You are family; the last thing I want to do is cause any offense."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2402
translate english c26s004_SamSim_66e36d96:

    # sam "Sabemos que tu intención es buena, [mc], pero no te preocupes. A final de año terminaré de pagar el coche."
    sam "We know you mean well, [mc], but don't worry. I'll finish paying for the car by the end of the year."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2403
translate english c26s004_SamSim_241224e6:

    # sam "Después sólo quedarán otros tres préstamos por pagar y por fin podremos ir más desahogados."
    sam "After that, there will only be three loans left to pay off, and we'll finally be able to breathe easier."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2405
translate english c26s004_SamSim_a2709fe9:

    # sim "*Risa* ¡Nadaremos en billetes cuando paguemos todos los préstamos!"
    sim "*Laugh* We'll be swimming in cash when we pay off all the loans!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2406
translate english c26s004_SamSim_c7f737ab:

    # mc "¿No podéis refinanciar alguno?"
    mc "Can't you refinance any of the loans?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2408
translate english c26s004_SamSim_d1878565:

    # sam "Lo estuve mirando, pero sale muy caro. Nos subirían el interés casi al doble. Y con nuestro historial es muy difícil que nos lo aprueben."
    sam "I looked into it, but it's very expensive. They would almost double our interest rate. And with our financial history, it's very unlikely that they would approve it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2409
translate english c26s004_SamSim_023591be:

    # mc "¿Me dejarías hacer unas comprobaciones sin que os ofendáis?"
    mc "Would you mind if I checked a few things without causing any offense?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2411
translate english c26s004_SamSim_0d26c5b2:

    # sam "Si no incluye darnos dinero puedes hacer todas las comprobaciones que quieras. Ya te he dicho que no vamos a aceptar caridad."
    sam "If it doesn't involve giving us money, you can do all the checks you want. I already told you that we won't accept charity."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2412
translate english c26s004_SamSim_51563c5e:

    # mc "Vale. Déjame hablar con Jam y con [nor] para mirar si la idea que se me acaba de ocurrir es posible."
    mc "Okay. Let me talk to Jam and [nor] to see if the idea I just came up with is possible."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2413
translate english c26s004_SamSim_733c9ce6:

    # mc "¿Os queda mucho que comprar?"
    mc "Do you still have much to buy?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2415
translate english c26s004_SamSim_58c373a7:

    # sim "No, ya lo tenemos todo."
    sim "No, we already have everything."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2416
translate english c26s004_SamSim_97a3b164:

    # mc "Pero si no lleváis nada..."
    mc "But you're not carrying anything..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2417
translate english c26s004_SamSim_52505e88:

    # sim "Lo está embolsando Arthur en la caja."
    sim "Arthur is bagging it at the counter."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2418
translate english c26s004_SamSim_8a6dac9d:

    # mc "Dejadme coger unas latas de atún y os ayudo a llevar la compra al coche. A [nor] se le acabó ayer."
    mc "Let me grab some cans of tuna and I'll help you carry the groceries to the car. [nor] ran out yesterday."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2420
translate english c26s004_SamSim_20b38d85:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Vosotras también? ¡Ese gato va a pesar 300 kilos si sigue viniendo cada domingo!"
    mc "*Laugh* You too? That cat is going to weigh 300 kilos if it keeps coming every Sunday!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2422
translate english c26s004_SamSim_e53cb773:

    # sim "¿Verdad que sí? Te mira con esos ojitos..." (multiple=2)
    sim "Isn't that right? He looks at you with those big eyes..." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2423
translate english c26s004_SamSim_d0eebdc9:

    # sam "Es que es irresistible..." (multiple=2)
    sam "He's just irresistible..." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2424
translate english c26s004_SamSim_fe473a4f:

    # sam "Te esperamos en la caja, coge mucho atún para el domingo que viene."
    sam "We'll see you at the checkout. Grab lots of tuna for next Sunday."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2430
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_002eff64:

    # "Después de dejar la compra de los Washington en su coche y despediros, mientras caminas hacia donde has aparcado la camioneta..."
    "After leaving the Washingtons' groceries in their car and saying goodbye, as you walk back to where you parked the pickup truck..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2431
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_42620791:

    # mcp "(Jamaal y... ¿Anthony?)"
    mcp "(Jamaal and... Anthony?)"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2433
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_5b6686d9:

    # mcp "(Sí, es Anthony. Ese coche es inconfundible.)"
    mcp "(Yes, that's Anthony. That car is unmistakable.)"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2435
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_ba030134:

    # mc "Hey, Jam."
    mc "Hey, Jam."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2437
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_ccede0c5:

    # jam "¡Joder, hermano! ¡Me has asustado!"
    jam "Damn, bro! You scared me!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2438
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_554cf447:

    # mc "¿Por qué? *Risa* ¿Tienes algo que ocultar?"
    mc "Why? *Laugh* You got something to hide?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2439
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_175e53af:

    # mc "*Risa* Y no me refiero a esa cara. Deberías ir con careta por la calle para no traumatizar a los niños."
    mc "*Laugh* And I don't mean that face. You should wear a mask when you go out, so you don't traumatize the neighborhood kids."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2441
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_237a5cce:

    # jam "Te lo pensaba contar..."
    jam "I was going to tell you..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2442
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_72b156b1:

    # mc "¿El qué? No he visto {b}absolutamente nada{/b} que no quieras que haya visto."
    mc "What? I didn't see {b}absolutely anything{/b} that you didn't want me to see."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2444
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_dc1988f2:

    # jam "No es eso... Me has pillado fuera de juego."
    jam "It's not that... You caught me off guard."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2445
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_1186339d:

    # jam "He venido a este barrio para no cruzarme con [sim] ni con mi madre, y me cruzo contigo... Eso es mala suerte."
    jam "I came to this neighborhood to avoid running into [sim] or my mother, and I ran into you... That's bad luck."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2446
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_66db30c9:

    # mc "No te quejes de suerte. Acabo de dejar a tu madre y a tu hermana en el coche. Tienes suerte que hayan ido en dirección contraria, si les quieres ocultar algo."
    mc "Don't complain about your luck. I just dropped your mother and sister off in their car."
    mc "You're lucky they went in the opposite direction if you wanted to hide something from them."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2447
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_49350649:

    # mc "Sea lo que sea... yo no he visto nada, pero seguramente ellas no serían ciegas selectivas como lo soy yo."
    mc "Whatever it was... I didn't see anything, but surely they weren't as selectively blind as I am."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2449
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_88870557:

    # jam "Eres un amigo jodidamente bueno. Lo sabes, ¿verdad?"
    jam "You're a damn good friend. You know that, right?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2450
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_f9b941b5:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo sé. ¿Quieres tomar un café?"
    mc "*Laugh* I know. Want to grab a coffee?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2452
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_0e86a769:

    # jam "Sí, tengo algo que contarte que me convertirá en un dios capaz de curar la ceguera... *Risa* al menos la selectiva."
    jam "Yes, I have something to tell you that will make me a god capable of curing blindness... *Laugh* at least selective blindness."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2453
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_27abb335:

    # mc "Vamos. ¿Conoces algún sitio por aquí cerca en el que hagan buen café?"
    mc "Let's go. Do you know of anywhere nearby that serves good coffee?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2454
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_3b4c6958:

    # jam "Sí, el bar del que acabo de salir. *Risa*"
    jam "Yes, the bar I just left. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2456
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_132aeaf1:

    # "Una vez sentados en el bar... Una vez {b}tú{/b} te sientas en el bar..."
    "Once seated at the bar... Once {b}you are seated{/b} at the bar..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2457
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_727bf874:

    # jam "Te aseguro que te lo iba a contar."
    jam "I promise, I was going to tell you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2458
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_e46032ed:

    # mc "Lo sé. Precisamente he hablado de eso con tu madre y tu hermana. Lo contarías cuando estuvieras preparado."
    mc "I know. I just talked about that with your mom and sister. You'll tell everyone when you're ready, if there's anything to tell."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2459
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_afe71008:

    # mc "Pero no nos debes explicaciones a nadie. Es tu vida y estaremos ahí cuando quieras, no para sacarte unas explicaciones que no quieres dar."
    mc "But you don't owe anyone any explanations. It's your life, and we'll be there when you want us to be, not to get explanations you don't want to give."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2461
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_51306f15:

    # jam "Es complicado... Nos conocimos hace un par de semanas. Casi lo atropello cuando él salía de una papelería."
    jam "It's complicated... We met a couple of weeks ago. I almost ran him over when he was leaving a stationery store."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2462
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_dc351162:

    # jam "Fue el día que viniste a casa y mi madre me dio unas cajas de pizza para tirar... y me quedé sin pastitas."
    jam "It was the day you came over and my mom gave me some pizza boxes to throw away... and I couldn't get any pastries."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2463
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_fd6bef66:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo recuerdo."
    mc "*Laugh* I remember that."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2465
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_7224580d:

    # jam "Iba despistado hablando con su hermana por teléfono y no me vio. Se sintió fatal y empezó a pedir disculpas como un loco."
    jam "He was distracted, talking to his sister on the phone, and didn't see me. He felt terrible and started apologizing like crazy."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2466
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_02b801e2:

    # mc "Joder, Jam, si me lo cuentas así me puedo imaginar la escena típica de película de instituto en la que el chico le tira los libros a la chica."
    mc "Damn, Jam, when you put it like that, I can just picture the typical high school movie scene where the guy throws the girl's books after bumping into her."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2468
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_9efff2a2:

    # jam "*Risa* No irías muy desencaminado. Pero no le tiré los libros, ni los papeles que llevaba. No llegué a atropellarlo."
    jam "*Laugh* You wouldn't be far off the mark. But I didn't throw his books or papers down. I didn't run him over."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2469
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_680e5841:

    # jam "Total, que me dijo que me pagaba un café porque era culpa suya. Fuimos a aquel café al que fuimos cuando tenías que ir a comisaría."
    jam "So, he said he would buy me a coffee because it was his fault. We went to that café where we went when you had to go to the police station."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2471
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_70a7f7d0:

    # jam "Empezamos a hablar y nos caímos bien..."
    jam "We started talking and we got along well..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2472
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_d12191db:

    # mc "Y os pusisteis a follar como locos en el lavabo. *Risa*"
    mc "And you started fucking like rabbits in the bathroom. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2474
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_49aed14e:

    # jam "No, qué va. Por eso te decía que es complicado. Él estaba intentando descubrir cómo se sentía respecto a su sexualidad. Estaba quedando con una chica y..."
    jam "No, not at all. That's why I was saying it's complicated. He was trying to figure out how he felt about his sexuality. He was seeing a girl and..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2475
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_bccb57a4:

    # mc "Sí, lo sé. [lis]."
    mc "Yeah, I know. [lis]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2477
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_f3f48b87:

    # jam "¿Qué? ¿[lis]? ¿{b}Nuestra{/b} [lis]?"
    jam "What? [lis]? {b}Our{/b} [lis]?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2478
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_4917f6d5:

    # mc "Sí, nuestra [lis]. Se habían conocido online mientras ella estaba en Phoenix."
    mc "Yes, our [lis]. They met online while she was in Phoenix."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2479
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_afbfa27f:

    # jam "¡Joder, hermano! Eso no lo sabía. Me dijo el nombre, pero no lo relacioné con nuestra [lis]."
    jam "Damn, bro! I didn't know that. He told me her name, but I didn't connect it with our [lis]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2482
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_b3b573c8:

    # jam "Siempre que la he visto parecía tener ojos sólo para ti."
    jam "Whenever I saw her, she seemed to have eyes only for you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2484
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_31278035:

    # jam "Si me hubieran preguntado, hubiera dicho que estaba colada por ti."
    jam "If you had asked me, I would have said that she was head over heels for you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2485
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_5900038e:

    # jam "Pero bueno, a lo que iba... estaba intentando descubrir cómo se sentía, con lo que no hicimos nada. Nos intercambiamos los teléfonos, pero en plan buen rollo. Nada más."
    jam "But anyway, back to what I was saying... he was trying to find out how he felt, so we didn't do anything. We exchanged phone numbers, but just as friends. Nothing more."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2487
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_d406c626:

    # jam "Me llamó al cabo de unos días para quedar a tomar otro café. Estuvimos hablando y ya había resuelto lo de la chica... lo de [lis]."
    jam "He called me a few days later to meet up for another coffee. We talked, and he had already sorted things out with that girl... with [lis]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2488
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_821690be:

    # mc "*Risa* Es divertido ver cómo conocemos la misma historia desde dos perspectivas diferentes."
    mc "*Laugh* It's funny how we know the same story from two different perspectives."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2490
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_323d2bc2:

    # jam "Sí que lo es. Pero bueno... Continuando mi historia..."
    jam "Yes, it is. But anyway... Continuing with my story..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2491
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_ce13f9b1:

    # jam "Quedamos un par de veces más antes de besarnos por primera vez la semana pasada."
    jam "We met up a couple more times before kissing for the first time last week."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2492
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_bf406565:

    # mc "¿El martes?"
    mc "On Tuesday?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2494
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_1f8798a7:

    # jam "¿Cómo lo sabes?"
    jam "How do you know?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2495
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_618e2dda:

    # mc "Estuve en tu casa y tu madre me dijo que habías quedado con un amigo."
    mc "I was at your place, and your mom told me you were out with a friend."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2497
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_482a2090:

    # jam "*Risa* Y como no tengo más amigos aparte de ti..."
    jam "*Laugh* And since I don't have any other friends besides you..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2498
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_0151713c:

    # mc "*Risa* Exacto."
    mc "*Laugh* Exactly."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2499
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_9c5b81a0:

    # jam "*Risa* Pero quedamos más veces esa semana, podría haber sido el jueves o el sábado."
    jam "*Laugh* But we met up several times that week, so it could have been on Thursday or Saturday."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2500
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_d78c9434:

    # mc "Entonces hubieras dicho hace cuatro días o hace dos. 'La semana pasada' suena más lejano que 'dos o cuatro días'."
    mc "Then you would have said four days ago or two days ago. 'Last week' sounds further away than 'two or four days'."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2502
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_202c04e1:

    # jam "¡[dap]! ¡Abandona el cuerpo de mi amigo! ¡Él no es tan listo como para deducir eso! *Risa*"
    jam "[dap]! Leave my friend's body! He's not smart enough to figure that out! *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2503
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_f4b8323d:

    # mc "*Risa* Vivir con 15 mujeres hace que desarrolles un sexto sentido, hermano."
    mc "*Laugh* Living with 15 women makes you develop a sixth sense, bro."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2504
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_c7bb5032:

    # mc "Pero decías que lo de Anthony es complicado. No le veo la complicación por ningún sitio. Os conocisteis, encajasteis, y estáis saliendo."
    mc "But you said Anthony's situation is complicated. I don't see the complication anywhere. You met, you hit it off, and you're dating."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2506
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_ee1830ef:

    # jam "Es más complicado que eso..."
    jam "It's more complicated than that..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2508
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_bcf6ed30:

    # mc "Si lo dices por [lis], no te preocupes. Se veía que era una pareja que no podía funcionar. Tú has acabado saliendo con uno y yo con la otra."
    mc "If you mean [lis], don't worry about it. It was obvious that they weren't going to make it as a couple. You ended up dating one of them, and I ended up dating the other."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2510
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_d3fa9ecf:

    # mc "Si lo dices por [lis], no te preocupes. Se veía que era una pareja que no podía funcionar."
    mc "If you mean [lis], don't worry about it. It was obvious that they weren't going to make it as a couple."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2512
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_4ea71113:

    # jam "No es por [lis], pero no me corresponde a mí contártelo."
    jam "It's not because of [lis], but it's not my business to tell you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2513
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_1cc2e512:

    # mc "¿Por qué no lo traes a casa un domingo? Cuando estéis preparados para presentárselo a la familia como tu pareja. Sin prisa y sin presión."
    mc "Why not bring him home one Sunday? When you're ready to introduce him to the family as your partner. No rush, no pressure."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2514
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_125a6356:

    # mc "Muchas de las chicas ya lo conocen de la noche en el Jazz Corner, antes del cumpleaños de [emm], [eri], y [dap]."
    mc "Many of the girls already know him from the night at the Jazz Corner, before [emm], [eri], and [dap]'s birthday."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2516
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_d868a0c3:

    # jam "Sería una buena idea, pero antes quiero presentárselo a mi madre y a mi hermana."
    jam "That would be a good idea, but first I want to talk to my mom and sister about it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2517
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_0ba29a9f:

    # mc "Es lógico que lo hagas."
    mc "It makes sense that you would do that."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2518
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_1bd99f52:

    # jam "Dame un poco de tiempo. Anthony es tímido."
    jam "Give me a little time. Anthony is shy."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2519
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_bf56c6e9:

    # mc "Todo el tiempo que necesites. Ya te he dicho que no hay prisa, pero esta ciudad es pequeña y es fácil que alguien os vea."
    mc "Take all the time you need. I already told you there's no rush, but this is a small town and it's easy for someone to see you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2521
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_d80eef61:

    # jam "Eres el mejor amigo que se puede tener. Bueno, lo serías si fueras gay. *Risa*"
    jam "You're the best friend anyone could have. Well, you would be if you were gay. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2522
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_bfacbf9b:

    # mc "*Risa* Entonces me estarías tirando los trastos todo el día. La excusa de que no te gustan los blancos ya no cuela."
    mc "*Laugh* Then you'd be hitting on me all day long. The excuse that you don't like white guys doesn't work anymore."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2524
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_f92f564e:

    # jam "Eso lo decía cuando tenía un crush contigo..."
    jam "I said that when I had a crush on you..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2526
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_a4026a05:

    # mc "¿QUÉ? ¿Cuándo has tenido un crush conmigo?"
    mc "WHAT? When did you have a crush on me?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2528
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_2f7ee26a:

    # jam "En el instituto, el último año. No te preocupes, duró poco. ¿Recuerdas lo desastrosas que fueron mis relaciones aquel año?"
    jam "In high school, senior year. Don't worry, it didn't last long. Remember how disastrous my relationships were that year?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2529
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_a5349bd8:

    # mc "Claro que lo recuerdo. Ibas de un capullo al siguiente. Creo que saliste con todos los gays capullos del instituto."
    mc "Sure. You went from one jerk to the next. I think you dated every gay jerk in high school."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2531
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_ba7c02df:

    # jam "Exacto. Y, por otro lado, tenía que veros a [eil] y a ti todos los días. Yo quería eso, pero solo conseguía capullos."
    jam "True. And on the other hand, I had to see [eil] and you every day. I wanted that, but all I got were jerks."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2532
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_372f01c0:

    # mc "Joder, Jam. Lo siento. Nunca pensé que te pudiera afectar."
    mc "Damn, Jam. I'm sorry. I never thought it would affect you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2534
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_1e09e7f9:

    # jam "Ya te digo que duró poco. Obviamente era imposible, con lo que seguí encadenando capullos."
    jam "I told you it didn't last long. Obviously, it was impossible, so I kept stringing jerks one after another."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2535
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_187e87be:

    # mc "Tío, cosas como esas me las tenías que haber dicho."
    mc "Man, you should have told me things like that."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2537
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_36f8ac3c:

    # jam "¿Y arriesgar nuestra amistad? ¡Ni de coña, hermano!"
    jam "And risk our friendship? No way, bro!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2538
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_805dcf55:

    # mc "No hubiera pasado. Nuestra amistad está por encima de esas cosas."
    mc "Nothing would have happened. Our friendship is above such things."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2539
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_4165b9e3:

    # jam "Hubiera sido más plausible volverme hetero y tener el crush con [eil]. *Risa* Al fin y al cabo tú eras un capullo más."
    jam "It would have been more plausible to become straight and have the crush on [eil]. *Laugh* After all, you were just another jerk."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2540
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_8b02208e:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que soy tan capullo porque te acepté como mascota. *Risa* ¿Te pido un platito de Dog Chew?"
    mc "*Laugh* I think I'm such a jerk for taking you in as a pet. *Laugh* Can I get you a plate of Dog Chew?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2542
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_630da4d1:

    # jam "¿Ves cómo eres un capullo? *Risa* Pero eres el mejor amigo que se puede tener."
    jam "See how much of a jerk you are? *Laugh* But you're the best friend anyone could have."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2543
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_feb03b66:

    # mc "Hablando de amigos... ¿Qué sabes de los préstamos de tu madre?"
    mc "You're getting repetitive, but speaking of friends... What do you know about your mother's loans?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2545
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_f18fad41:

    # jam "Que se llevan casi todo el dinero que entra en casa. Mis facturas médicas fueron muy caras y mi madre se endeudó mucho."
    jam "They take almost all the money that comes into the house. My medical bills were very high, and my mother got into a lot of debt."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2546
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_3b229914:

    # mc "¿Puedes conseguir los datos de esos préstamos? Banco, importe que debe todavía..."
    mc "Can you get the details of those loans? Bank, amount still owed..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2548
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_d7662476:

    # jam "No estás pensando en pagar esos préstamos, ¿verdad? Mi madre no lo va a consentir."
    jam "You're not thinking of paying back those loans, are you? My mother won't allow it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2549
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_7c60c98c:

    # mc "Lo sé, pero se me ha ocurrido una idea que tengo que consultar con [nor]."
    mc "I know, but I have an idea that I need to discuss with [nor]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2550
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_5cc6955e:

    # jam "¿Qué idea? A veces me preocupas..."
    jam "What idea? You worry me sometimes..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2552
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_ea7fca00:

    # "Le explicas tu idea a Jamaal. Le parece factible, aunque no sabe cómo se la va a tomar [sam]."
    "You explain your idea to Jamaal. He thinks it's feasible, although he doesn't know how [sam] will take it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2553
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_9ec308ae:

    # "Te dice que buscará los datos necesarios y te los enviará por correo electrónico."
    "He tells you that he will look for the necessary information and send it to you by email."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2555
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_7222c54b:

    # "Al cabo de un rato os despedís. Se acerca la hora de la cena y vuelves a casa con las latas de atún."
    "After a while, you say goodbye. It's almost dinner time, and you return home with the cans of tuna."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2556
translate english c26s004_Jamaal_cef389de:

    # "Olvidas comprar lo que venías a comprar a la ciudad. Ya volverás mañana."
    "You forget to buy what you came to downtown for. You'll come back tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2564
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_a2efb0d3:

    # "Al llegar a casa, pasas por la cocina de [nor] a entregar las latas de atún."
    "When you arrive home, you go through the kitchen to give [nor] the cans of tuna."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2565
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_104789dc:

    # mc "Hola, [nor]. Te traigo las latas que me ha pedido [eil] para el Monstruo del Atún."
    mc "Hello, [nor]. I brought you the cans that [eil] asked me to get for the Tuna Monster."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2566
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_86edf77a:

    # nor "*Risa* Me imaginé que alguna de las chicas le daría alguna lata, pero no que me dejarían sin atún."
    nor "*Laugh* I figured some of the girls would give him a can or two, but I didn't think they'd leave me without any tuna."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2567
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_e9de8269:

    # nor "Es difícil resistirse cuando te mira como el gato de la película del ogro y el burro."
    nor "It's hard to resist when he looks at you like the cat in the movie with the ogre and the donkey."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2568
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_09799f28:

    # mc "Por cierto, me he encontrado con [sam] y [sim] en la tienda."
    mc "By the way, I ran into [sam] and [sim] at the store."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2570
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_025078d0:

    # nor "Ese 'por cierto' me suena a que se te ha ocurrido alguna idea que las atañe."
    nor "That 'by the way' sounds to me like you've come up with an idea that concerns them."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2571
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_1d1f2d84:

    # mc "Más o menos. Jamaal me tiene que enviar una información que le he pedido, pero quería consultar contigo si era plausible."
    mc "More or less. Jamaal has to send me some information I asked him for, but I wanted to check with you first to see if it was feasible."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2573
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_3ac5d717:

    # nor "A ver, explícame esa idea. Menos mal que tus ideas suelen funcionar mejor que las de [emm]."
    nor "Let me hear this idea. Thankfully, your ideas tend to work better than [emm]'s."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2574
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_a2f5838b:

    # mc "Déjame tu móvil para enseñarte los cálculos que he hecho en mi cabeza."
    mc "Give me your cell phone so I can show you the calculations I've done in my head."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2576
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_9eb8b25f:

    # "Le explicas tu plan y cree que puede ser factible. Te pide que le pases la información que te mande Jamaal en cuanto la tengas."
    "You explain your plan to her, and she thinks it might work. She asks you to forward her any information Jamaal sends you as soon as you receive it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2577
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_03f6e42a:

    # "Ella se apunta al plan y colaborará en llevarlo a cabo. Habrá que hacer algunas cosas que posiblemente no de tiempo de acabar antes de que te tengas que ir a Aruba."
    "She's on board with the plan and will help you carry it out. There will be some things to do that may not be finished before you have to leave for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2578
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_4f688e9d:

    # "Te dice que eso puede ser bueno. Conociendo a [sam] y a [sim], que haya medio continente y un mar entre vosotros cuando se enteren es idóneo para tu seguridad."
    "She tells you that it could be a good thing. Knowing [sam] and [sim], having half a continent and a sea between you when they find out, will be ideal for your safety."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2579
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_7dda0259:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2580
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_53e02338:

    # "Suena su teléfono."
    "Your phone rings."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2582
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_18310fcf:

    # nor "Hola, cielo."
    nor "Hello, sunshine."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2583
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_a2856f8d:

    # nor "Sí, está conmigo en la cocina."
    nor "Yes, he's here with me in the kitchen."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2584
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_69d1bdf8:

    # nor "Ahora se lo digo."
    nor "I'll tell him now."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2586
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_0295007b:

    # nor "Era [dap]. Está en tu habitación y quiere que vayas cuando puedas."
    nor "It was [dap]. She's in your room and wants you to go see her when you can."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2587
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_f7d009f7:

    # mc "OK. Ahora voy. Te mando la información en cuanto Jamaal me la envíe."
    mc "OK. I'll go now. I'll forward the information to you as soon as Jamaal sends it to me."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2591
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_850564e6:

    # nor "Hasta luego. La cena está en el horno y estará preparada en media hora más o menos. Cenamos aquí."
    nor "See you later. Dinner is in the oven and will be ready in about half an hour. We'll have dinner here."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2592
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_9c26590e:

    # mc "Voy a ver qué quiere [dap] y bajamos a cenar."
    mc "I'll see what [dap] wants, and then we'll come down for dinner."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2593
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_dff97d5f:

    # nor "Mientras vas a verla, yo voy a cambiarme. Preguntále a [mar] si necesita ayuda para traer la comida cuando vengas, por favor."
    nor "While you go see her, I'll go change. Please ask [mar] if she needs help bringing anything when you return here."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2594
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_3715992d:

    # "Ya nadie le da importancia a que, de vez en cuando, vaya en ropa interior o, como en este caso, en bikini y un vestido transparente."
    "No one cares anymore if she occasionally appears in her underwear or, as in this case, in a bikini and a see-through dress."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2596
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_f1bce70a:

    # "Al llegar a tu habitación..."
    "When you arrive at your room..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2597
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_8c0ef9a9:

    # mc "Hola, [eva]. [nor] me ha dicho que [dap] me estaba buscando."
    mc "Hello, [eva]. [nor] informed me that [dap] was looking for me."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2599
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_de2d9d40:

    # eva "¿[eva]?"
    eva "[eva]?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2600
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_c842d779:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa, [eva]?"
    mc "What's up, [eva]?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2601
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_3d99824b:

    # mc "¡Ah! Ahora lo veo. Te has peinado como [dap]."
    mc "Ah! Now I see. You've styled your hair like [dap]."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2603
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_c01fd78d:

    # eva "¿Qué ha fallado en mi disfraz? ¿Cómo lo has sabido?"
    eva "What's wrong with my disguise? How did you know?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2604
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_908f7460:

    # mc "No lo sé. He entrado y sabía que eras tú."
    mc "I don't know. I walked in and knew it was you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2606
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_9b2d7e53:

    # eva "Pero algo me tiene que haber delatado... Somos idénticas."
    eva "But something must have given me away... We're identical."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2607
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_c4cd161c:

    # mc "Si tuviera que racionalizarlo... [dap] no tiene esos músculos. Y además, puedo verle un pie detrás del armario, aunque no me había fijado hasta ahora."
    mc "If I had to rationalize it... [dap] doesn't have those muscles. And besides, I can see one of her feet behind the cabinet, although I hadn't noticed it until now."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2609
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_1259854e:

    # dap "Te dije que no funcionaría. Además, no hablas como yo."
    dap "I told you it wouldn't work. Besides, you don't talk like me."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2610
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_20d8f3e3:

    # mc "Bueno, no le he dado tiempo a hablar."
    mc "Well, I didn't give her a chance to speak."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2612
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_4817a561:

    # dap "Creía que la ibas a detectar por la voz, pero tienes razón, no ha hablado."
    dap "I thought you would detect her by her voice, but you're right, she didn't speak."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2614
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_e672befd:

    # mc "Pero ¿realmente pensáis que no distinguiría a una de mis chicas de la otra?"
    mc "But do you really think I wouldn't be able to tell one of my girls from another?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2616
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_20906518:

    # mc "Pero ¿realmente pensáis que no sabría con quién estoy saliendo y con quién no?"
    mc "But do you really think I wouldn't know who I'm dating and who I'm not?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2618
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_3d063249:

    # mc "Pero ¿realmente pensáis que no os distinguiría?"
    mc "But do you really think I wouldn't distinguish you?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2619
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_c6712a98:

    # mc "Las dos sois únicas e inconfundibles."
    mc "You are both unique and unmistakable."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2621
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_a419c601:

    # dap "A veces es monísimo..."
    dap "Sometimes he's really cute..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2622
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_be518627:

    # eva "Dan ganas de darle un abrazo y romperle un par de huesos..."
    eva "It makes you want to give him a bear hug and break a couple of his ribs..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2623
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_f9c71371:

    # mc "*Risa* Acepto ese abrazo pero, si puede ser, me gustaría conservar mis huesos intactos."
    mc "*Laugh* I'll accept that hug, but if possible, I'd like to keep my ribs intact."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2625
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_a30aec49:

    # eva "¿Te acuerdas cuando no quería abrazos, [mc]?"
    eva "Do you remember when I didn't want hugs, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2626
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_afe8f3db:

    # mc "*Risa* Claro que me acuerdo. El disgusto por los abrazos te duró un minuto hasta que te abrazó [nor]."
    mc "*Laugh* Of course I remember. Your dislike for hugs lasted a minute, until [nor] hugged you."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2627
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_f61db452:

    # dap "*Risa* Lo hubieras pasado muy mal en esta familia si no lo hubieras superado."
    dap "*Laugh* You would have had a very hard time in this family if you hadn't gotten over it."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2628
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_8a3b5bc4:

    # eva "Me estáis volviendo blanda. ¡Pero me encanta!"
    eva "You're turning me into a softie. But I love it!"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2629
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_2cd2537e:

    # "Entre las muchas diferencias que puedes notar entre ambas está la diferencia de altura provocada por los zapatos de [dap]."
    "Among the many differences you can notice between the two is the difference in height caused by [dap]'s shoes."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2630
translate english c26s005_EvaDap_aaff0c8f:

