    lis "Yes, but I can cancel it if you don't want to..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2764
translate english c26s005_LisDebKat_78b9a2df:

    # mc "Me encantaría pasar la noche contigo en esa habitación de hotel. Me encantaría pasarla aunque fuera en un iglú."
    mc "I would love to spend the night with you in that hotel room. I would love to spend it even if it were in an igloo."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2766
