    # "[lis] se acerca y te da un suave beso en los labios. Supones que la respuesta ha sido la adecuada."
    "[lis] comes closer and gives you a soft kiss on the lips. You assume that your answer was the right one."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2769
translate english c26s005_LisDebKat_f8fcaee7:

    # lis "Perfecto, pero dejando de lado nuestra cita..."
    lis "Perfect, but putting our date aside..."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2771
translate english c26s005_LisDebKat_ad14648b:

    # lis "¿Cuándo vas a tener la primera cita con [deb.nick]?"
    lis "When are you going to have your first date with [deb.nick]?"

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2772
translate english c26s005_LisDebKat_b0ed05ee:

    # mc "No quiero sonar grosero, pero eso es algo entre ella y yo."
    mc "I don't want to sound rude, but that's between her and me."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2774
translate english c26s005_LisDebKat_d09e2e8f:

    # lis "Lo sé, lo sé. Pero creo que lo estás alargando demasiado. Hace siglos que os besasteis."
    lis "I know, I know. But I think you're dragging it out too long. It's been ages since you kissed."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2776
translate english c26s005_LisDebKat_869a7e68:

    # lis "Y no quiero que nuestra primera cita, en la fiesta, sea antes que la suya."
    lis "And I don't want our first date, at the party, to be before hers."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2777
translate english c26s005_LisDebKat_a1e47e77:

    # mc "[lis], no es una competición. Da lo mismo a quién besé primero para decidir con quién debo tener una cita primero."
    mc "[lis], it's not a competition. It doesn't matter who I kissed first to decide who I should go on a date with first."

# game/scripts/c26/c26.rpy:2779
translate english c26s005_LisDebKat_918c2431:

